                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Why do your miniatures cost more than mass-produced ones?",
                    "open_by_default": false
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_pRYKhQ": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "enable_custom_font": false,
                        "custom_class": "c",
                        "text": "<p>Because nothing here is cast in advance. Every figure is printed on demand in resin and hand-detailed. That takes five to seven working days, and with weekends inside that window a parcel can leave the Guild on the tenth or eleventh day. Shipping from the EU comes on top. A mass-produced mini is cheaper because it was made before anyone wanted it. What you pay for here is the one character your player has been describing for a year.</p>",
